			},
			"date": "2020-07-20T15:26:14.000Z",
			"content": "The Lighthouse Scores Will Continue Until Morale Improves <a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/11ty-lighthouse/\">zachleat.com/web/11ty-light…</a>",
			"type": "mention",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 829244,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/jouni_kantola/status/1285235478388715522",
			"author": {
				"name": "Jouni Kantola",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/jouni_kantola",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/ae76b95cbf0e5f1336efe568d8a8043c01cf09582dfaf3e1cefd5f2a0e3d359a.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2020-07-20T15:29:51.000Z",
			"content": "Have you seen any clear signals whether PWAs perform better or worse than sites without manifest and worker?\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.11ty.dev/docs/starter/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 829246,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/zachleat/status/1285235974293905413",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/d9711a9ad30ae05a761e4a728883bcbdd852cbf7d41437925b0afc47a8589795.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2020-07-20T15:31:49.000Z",
			"content": "Good question, I haven’t tested PWA yet and I don’t have plans to 🙈\n\nI do know that registering your service worker too early is a performance anti-pattern though!\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/jouni_kantola\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.11ty.dev/docs/starter/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 829285,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/nhoizey/status/1285251983994245120",
			"author": {
				"name": "Nicolas Hoizey",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/nhoizey",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/c21eff209ada91f6fe7e85dade06b7cd289b2c253324148110fe5c4ae2cb8021.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2020-07-20T16:35:26.000Z",
			"content": "BTW, what's the update frequency on <a href=\"https://www.11ty.dev/leaderboard/\">11ty.dev/leaderboard/</a> now?\n\nIt still says “updated approximately every other Sunday”, but June 8 seems far now… 😅\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.11ty.dev/docs/starter/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 829289,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/paulrobertlloyd/status/1285258638920085504",
			"author": {
				"name": "Paul Robert Lloyd",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/paulrobertlloyd",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/f95a657a35c90e8490f4bc36d946936ef217ff684ae6a03d6936954a8ed6f28f.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2020-07-20T17:01:53.000Z",
			"content": "This is great but… and this is something I’ve been thinking about in relation to my own work as well… frequently running tasks like this on remote infrastructure has an environmental cost. Is it unreasonable to feel increasingly uncomfortable with this trend?\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.11ty.dev/docs/starter/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		}
	],
